  mutate_once:
    kind: mutate
    deadline: 1h
    shell: {}
    input:
      type: object
      properties:
        command: {type: array, items: {type: string}}
    record:
      identity: $.command
      fields:
        exit_code: $.exit_code

CAPABILITIES        shell
BOUND               none
RECORD CARDINALITY  one
RECORD IDENTITY     $.command
REPEATABILITY       run-once
DEADLINE            1h
CONCURRENCY LIMIT   1
